{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The electronic version of the commemorative album for the first and second anniversary of the release of 'Byakuya Museum'! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Anniversary Commemorative Album\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BYAKUYA Secret Gallery</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">56p</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of selected artwork, text, cos, and more within the first anniversary of the release of Byakuya Museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to all the participants for the licence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Second Anniversary Commemorative Album\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the bottom of the well</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">56p</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It includes the related settings, images, and content of character id and Aifeimo in &quot;Byakuya Museum&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simultaneously attach a trial entry for the new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to the fact that neither commemorative album will be reprinted offline, an electronic version of the DLC commemorative album has been released~</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763530?t=1748239208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763530/c4730a2e8d849d646b763f0262c049ebdd0ddda0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748239208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763530/e4c8f83e1137efe9da4ffb47e963e6954c29598b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748239208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763530/e4c8f83e1137efe9da4ffb47e963e6954c29598b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748239208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Con